        <properties stereotype="ResourceArtifact" documentation="App-facing facade over the tracking/estimation core. Owns the IMM bank, associator, track manager, and async multi-rate/OOS fusion pipeline behind one trait, and projects the core's kinematic Track into the canonical gungnir-model TrackView. See ARCHITECTURE.md §2."/>
